#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:544
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MeteoriteWillActivateVolcano"
msgid ""
"The power contained in the METEORITE…\p"
"By amplifying its power with this\n"
"machine, MT. CHIMNEY's volcanic\l"
"activity will instantly intensify…\p"
"Its energy will grow deep inside\n"
"the crater and…\l"
"Fufufu…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:553
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MaxieIntro"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: Hm?\n"
"Who are you?\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"I'd heard ARCHIE bemoaning a child\n"
"who's been meddling in TEAM AQUA's\l"
"affairs.\p"
"It must be you he meant.\p"
"Humph! So you're thinking of\n"
"interfering with us, TEAM MAGMA?\p"
"Now you listen.\n"
"Long ago, living things used the\l"
"land to live and grow.\p"
"That is why land is all important!\n"
"It is the cradle of all!\p"
"That is why TEAM MAGMA is dedicated\n"
"to the expansion of the land mass.\p"
"It is for further advancement of\n"
"humankind and POKéMON!\p"
"And for that, we need the power of\n"
"what sleeps within this mountain…\p"
"Oh! There was no need for you to\n"
"learn that much.\p"
"But, no matter!\n"
"I'll teach you the consequences of\l"
"meddling in our grand design!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:581
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MaxieDefeat"
msgid ""
"What?!\p"
"I, MAXIE, was caught off guard?!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:585
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MaxieYouHaventSeenLastOfMagma"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: But, enough.\n"
"I will back off this time.\p"
"But don't think that this is the last\n"
"you've seen of TEAM MAGMA.\p"
"Fufufu…\p"
"Even without the METEORITE, if we\n"
"obtain that ORB… Fufufu…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:594
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_TabithaIntro"
msgid ""
"Hehehe!\p"
"So you've come all the way here!\p"
"But you're too late!\n"
"I've already delivered the METEORITE\l"
"from METEOR FALLS to the BOSS!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:601
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_TabithaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Hehehe…\p"
"Even though I've lost, if our leader\n"
"awakens that thing…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:606
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_TabithaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"BOSS, hurry!\n"
"Give it the METEORITE's energy!\p"
"Hehehe…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:611
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_Grunt2Intro"
msgid ""
"We of TEAM MAGMA are working hard for\n"
"everyone's sake.\p"
"Like, if that thing's power made more\n"
"land, there'd be more places to live.\p"
"Everyone'd be happy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:618
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_Grunt2Defeat"
msgid ""
"Hunh?\n"
"What do you mean I lost?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:622
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_Grunt2PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Our BOSS says, “It will make everyone\n"
"happy.”\p"
"But why does everyone keep getting\n"
"in our way?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:628
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_Grunt1Intro"
msgid ""
"If there were more land, I'd be able\n"
"to get a big house of my own!\p"
"I'm going to build it on hardened lava!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:633
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_Grunt1Defeat"
msgid "My dream of a big house…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:636
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_Grunt1PostBattle"
msgid ""
"A kid like you, you ought to be\n"
"splashing about in the waves!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:640
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_TeamAquaAlwaysMessingWithPlans"
msgid ""
"That annoying TEAM AQUA…\n"
"They always mess with our plans!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:644
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MeteoritesPackAmazingPower"
msgid "METEORITES pack amazing power!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:647
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_YouBetterNotMessWithUs"
msgid ""
"You'd better not mess with us!\p"
"We're trying to awaken that thing\n"
"for the benefit of everyone!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:652
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_AquasNameSimilar"
msgid ""
"We're TEAM MAGMA!\p"
"They're TEAM AQUA!\p"
"It totally annoys me that they'd\n"
"use a name like ours!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:658
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_DouseThemInFire"
msgid ""
"Yeah!\n"
"Douse them in fire!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:662
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_KeepMakingMoreLand"
msgid "We're going to keep making more land!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:665
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_Bufoh"
msgid "Bufoh!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:668
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ArchieGoStopTeamMagma"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: Grr, {PLAYER}!\n"
"I should've guessed you'd show up!\p"
"See for yourself what the fanatics\n"
"of TEAM MAGMA are up to!\p"
"They're trying to inject the stolen\n"
"METEORITE's power into the volcano!\p"
"Doing something like that will cause\n"
"the volcano's eruption!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:678
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ArchieIHaveMyHandsFull"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: Grrr…\p"
"I want to stop that MAXIE,\n"
"but I can't!\p"
"Not when I have my hands full battling\n"
"three opponents at once!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:685
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ArchieThankYou"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: {PLAYER}!\n"
"Thank you!\p"
"With your help, we thwarted TEAM\n"
"MAGMA's destructive plan!\p"
"But… You…\n"
"Whose side are you on?\p"
"Ah, it doesn't matter.\p"
"We will remain vigilant and keep up\n"
"our pursuit of TEAM MAGMA.\p"
"{PLAYER}, we shall meet again!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:697
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MagmaOutnumbersUs"
msgid ""
"Darn… TEAM MAGMA outnumbers us!\n"
"We can't keep up with them!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:701
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_LessHabitatForWaterPokemon"
msgid ""
"If they expand the land, there'll be\n"
"less habitats for WATER POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:705
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MagmasNameSimilar"
msgid ""
"We're TEAM AQUA!\p"
"They're TEAM MAGMA!\p"
"It burns me up that they'd use such\n"
"a confusing name!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:711
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_Bushaa"
msgid "Bushaa!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:714
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_LavaCookiesJust200"
msgid ""
"LAVA COOKIES are MT. CHIMNEY's local\n"
"specialty.\p"
"Try one. It's just ¥200.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:719
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ThankYouDear"
msgid "Thank you, dear!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:722
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_YouveNotGotTheMoney"
msgid ""
"Oh, dear. You can't buy a thing if\n"
"you've not got the money.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:726
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_OhFineThen"
msgid "Oh, fine then.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:729
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MeteoriteFittedOnMachine"
msgid ""
"A METEORITE is fitted on a mysterious\n"
"machine…\p"
"The machine seems to be storing\n"
"energy in the METEORITE.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:735
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_RemoveTheMeteorite"
msgid ""
"A METEORITE is fitted on a mysterious\n"
"machine…\p"
"Do you want to remove the METEORITE?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:740
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_PlayerRemovedMeteorite"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} removed the METEORITE from\n"
"the mysterious machine.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:744
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_PlayerLeftMeteorite"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} left the METEORITE where\n"
"it was.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:748
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MachineMakesNoResponse"
msgid ""
"This mysterious machine…\n"
"It makes no response whatsoever.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:752
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_RouteSign"
msgid ""
"{DOWN_ARROW} JAGGED PATH\n"
"LAVARIDGE TOWN AHEAD$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:756
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ShelbyIntro"
msgid ""
"I've been to the hot springs and\n"
"refreshed my tired bones.\l"
"Right now I'm feeling strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:761
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ShelbyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, my goodness.\n"
"Now, aren't you something!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:765
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ShelbyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Well, well, I've lost. I can't call\n"
"myself an EXPERT now, can I?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:769
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ShelbyRegister"
msgid ""
"Thank you, child. It was fun, as if\n"
"I were battling my own grandchild.\p"
"Please, come see me again for\n"
"a rematch.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:775
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ShelbyRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"If you can mesh your heart with those\n"
"of your POKéMON, why, you should be\l"
"able to achieve great things.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:780
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ShelbyRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, my goodness.\n"
"Now, aren't you something!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:784
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ShelbyPostRematch"
msgid ""
"Perhaps your heart has become one\n"
"with the hearts of your POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:788
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MelissaIntro"
msgid ""
"I've got the fire in me, baby.\n"
"I can't stand it! I have to battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:792
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MelissaDefeat"
msgid "Ooh, that was a scorching-hot match!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:795
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_MelissaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The heat of MT. CHIMNEY warms\n"
"me up, baby!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:799
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_SheilaIntro"
msgid ""
"I've finally made it to MT. CHIMNEY.\n"
"I want to make my POKéMON battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:803
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_SheilaDefeat"
msgid ""
"The way you battle…\n"
"It's like a MT. CHIMNEY eruption!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:807
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_SheilaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Like I said, I've finally made it to\n"
"MT. CHIMNEY. It would be a shame if\l"
"I only do a little sightseeing…\p"
"I want to get in some battles and buy\n"
"COOKIES as souvenirs.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:814
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ShirleyIntro"
msgid ""
"Since I bathed in the hot springs,\n"
"I've been feeling great!\l"
"I'm sure I'm going to win!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:819
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ShirleyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Yowch!\n"
"I'm getting a chill out of the water.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:823
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_ShirleyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'll have to take another dip in the\n"
"hot springs. Want to join me?\p"
"Just joking!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:828
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_SawyerIntro"
msgid ""
"This is one fine mountain! Plenty of\n"
"hot people around for company!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:832
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_SawyerDefeat"
msgid "Oh, you're a real firebrand, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:835
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_SawyerPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I think I need a dip in LAVARIDGE\n"
"HOT SPRING with the locals!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:839
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_SawyerRegister"
msgid ""
"I like little fireballs like you.\n"
"Let me register you in my POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:843
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_SawyerRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm happily surrounded by hot people\n"
"around these parts. I won't lose!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:847
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_SawyerRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Gosh, you're still the same\n"
"firebrand as before!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc:851
msgctxt "MtChimney_Text_SawyerPostRematch"
msgid ""
"Actually, it really is hot here.\n"
"I'm overdressed for these parts.$"
msgstr ""
